<title>USA: No damaging cold seen in Brazil coffee areas - WSC.</title>
<headline>No damaging cold seen in Brazil coffee areas - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for Brazil's coffee growing areas in the next five days, forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Drier weather favours ongoing harvests during the next several days, it said.</p>
<p>Partly sunny and mild weather is expected Friday with low temperatures of 52-65F expected on Friday night. Mild weather is forecast for Saturday through Tuesday.</p>
</text>
